      "content": "Here are a few options designed to be professional, helpful, and maintain a high level of perceived approachability for your sentiment analysis tool. Option one is direct and solution-oriented, while option two offers a slightly softer tone while remaining serious. Option three is concise, focusing purely on the necessary information while still using encouraging language.",
